xtRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1322],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76674/Q7667401","priority":5,"questId":76674,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":766740101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1322,"speakerName":"Nicole","textMapHash":2076683306,"text":"My oh my, the final product has exceeded all my expectations... If anyone actually does stumble in here by mistake, I'm sure they will be truly awe-inspired by this mage's might.","nextNodeIds":[766740102,766740103]},{"nodeId":766740102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":690825186,"text":"If someone really does end up here by accident...","nextNodeIds":[766740104]},{"nodeId":766740104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1322,"speakerName":"Nicole","textMapHash":3854041058,"text":"Well, that all depends on the sort of person they are.","nextNodeIds":[766740105]},{"nodeId":766740105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1322,"speakerName":"Nicole","textMapHash":1004466066,"text":"Guidance can encourage complacency and entitlement if you're not careful. If someone is eager to rely on their own abilities, like you do, then I'll gladly help them.","nextNodeIds":[766740106]},{"nodeId":766740106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1322,"speakerName":"Nicole","textMapHash":2277753850,"text":"But if they're the type of person who pins all their hopes on the mage's power, while doing none of the work themselves... Hehe.","nextNodeIds":[766740107]},{"nodeId":766740107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3221479914,"text":"...W—Would you really turn them into a statue?","nextNodeIds":[766740108]},{"nodeId":766740108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1322,"speakerName":"Nicole","textMapHash":1038914962,"text":"No, nothing like that. But I would guide them out of this place to the nearby Curatorium of Secrets. I'm sure Nefer would know how to deal with them much better than I do.","nextNodeI